# Archon of Emeria: "Nonbasic lands your opponents control enter tapped". A replacement effect that looks at what
# enters judges it as it would exist on the battlefield (CR 614.12): a card manifested face down is a 2/2 creature
# with no supertypes there (CR 701.40a, 708.2a), so a nonbasic land card manifested face down is not a nonbasic land
# and enters untapped. The real nonbasic land entering tapped is a-shockland-under-an-archon-is-ordered-by-its-controller.
#
# Turn 1: Bot1 Wheels off a Black Lotus and casts Abhorrent Oculus by exiling six graveyard cards. Turn 2, Bot2's
# upkeep: the Oculus manifests dread and Guerrilla Gorilla goes face down; Bot2 then casts Archon of Emeria off a Plains
# and a Black Lotus. Turn 4, Bot2's upkeep: the Oculus manifests dread again and Bot1 puts Tundra - a nonbasic land
# card - onto the battlefield face down, where it arrives untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Wheel of Fortune
Island x4
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Abhorrent Oculus
Island x4
Guerrilla Gorilla
Lightning Bolt
Island
Tundra
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x7
Plains
Black Lotus
Archon of Emeria
Plains x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Abhorrent Oculus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Island; Island; Island; Island; Black Lotus; Wheel of Fortune)
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
Bot1.Arrange(Guerrilla Gorilla | Lightning Bolt)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Archon of Emeria.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
Bot1.Arrange(Tundra | Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.#2.SummoningSick = true
Bot1.Battlefield.#2.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Archon of Emeria.Tapped = false
